Checked some other popular OFTs (LayerZero based crosschain tokens)

@EtherFi requires 2 DVNs confirmation
@ethena requires 3 DVNs confirmation
@USDT0_to requires 2 DVNs confirmation

Even ZRO from @LayerZero_Core themselves requires 2 DVNs before executing a transfer.

Two questions will need answers:
(1) how and why did Kelp oversee this critical configuration?
(2) how did @aave and DeFi in general allow interoperating rsETH at such a scale given this poor configuration?
